# E23d -- Validate the invasion exclusion against a REAL invader. E23b pinned cavern irritation at its maximum for two seasons and drew nothing, and its probe said why: did_first_cavern_announcement was false — CTRL had never opened a cavern. This opens it headlessly: every cavern layer feature marked Discovered (the flag DFHack's feature script toggles), the announcement flag set, three citizens teleported onto cavern 1's floor so the fort is IN the cavern, and irritation pinned at 100000 every sample. Two seasons. Control: untouched. If an invasion comes, the exclusion (addendum 49) must keep every invasion_id >= 0 unit out of the cavern count.
